<title>FRANCE: Five ships loading wheat in Rouen, three more due.</title>
<headline>Five ships loading wheat in Rouen, three more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five ships are loading a total of 87,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for export to Italy, Morocco and Tunisia, they said.</p>
<p>Three more ships are expected in port by February 24 to load around 18,000 tonnes of wheat to unspecified destinations.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
